Notes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

* The project contains no CAPTCHA solving service, no credential collection
  code and no mechanism that circumvents a licence check.
* The environment profile data (graphics device names, font family names,
  keyboard layouts, country and timezone pairs) is compiled from publicly
  documented platform specifications: the IANA time zone database, the Unicode
  CLDR, the WebGL and WebGPU specifications and the platform documentation of
  the vendors concerned.
